on ${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+7{R}_{2}$ to $A.$\n\nTo find $E,$ we apply the given row operation to the identity matrix as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+7{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =E\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equivalent notation in terms of matrix multiplication is $EA:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265988 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "090417bb-bda0-5586-94b2-46eceb1bcbb0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "A\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ -16 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263085} {:answer/id #uuid "1a096cdf-7202-57cc-a632-c055625d37b2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}16 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263249} {:answer/id #uuid "7da1c9d4-e363-5fed-ba08-cd3350bed811" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 16 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264083} {:answer/id #uuid "e47515dc-5670-5487-907c-2b04a5fa6d35" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 16 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264988} {:answer/id #uuid "e7e39e79-758a-5180-b1de-9ef5ce975ce7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 16\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265019}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 16 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264988} :answer-field/id #uuid "e20c3493-b518-5f90-8021-6c1e33bc6aff" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265645}] :question/id #uuid "7993ea70-2f40-5504-828e-aeb8566a66bb" :question/math-academy-id