/worked-solution "We need to find an elementary matrix $E$ such that $EA$ is equivalent to applying the elementary row operation ${R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1}$ to $A.$ \n\nTo find $E,$ we apply the given row operation to the identity matrix as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =E\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equivalent notation in terms of matrix multiplication is $EA:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186436821 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08df48ed-79af-5bf2-85ef-d1439433ab47" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -12\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186436756} {:answer/id #uuid "0f089b50-55e5-516b-9f45-db7bc3a03d01" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "A\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186436759} {:answer/id #uuid "487debef-ed20-58c1-b2bb-36f8c9abf586" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "A\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186436769} {:answer/id #uuid "6e60ea78-a600-5e26-8bc9-6dc62c40ffde" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-12 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186436776} {:answer/id #uuid "a1d1e1c7-900d-5649-b458-08e60264afaa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -12\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186436785}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -12\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186436785} :answer-field/id #uuid "3bba64a8-5bb2-5bab-90e3-aa7ac4488ef1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-fie