\end{bmatrix}\\ne q.\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false. Since $Pq\\ne q,$ it is not a steady-state vector of $P.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186269026 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b8516fd9-972d-5124-9e1f-77abae39069f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464036} {:answer/id #uuid "073c821c-d49c-5876-a77b-1da4d5924a43" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464037}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464037} :answer-field/id #uuid "231c2867-ceb4-5130-bef0-ff81c5a63d1d" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464952} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d8af554b-25df-5e46-9894-a73ef743708c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464038} {:answer/id #uuid "621d2a8c-2774-5f15-8dab-8efee3cdcf12" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464039}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464038} :answer-field/id #uuid "aed7b917-8fbd-5901-969a-cd52c74713f3" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464953} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ec83b78-b360-5108-9255-46479c4f5dcd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464040} {:answer/id #uuid "e106ba35-f647-5678-becd-ac768fc885dc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464041}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464040} :answer-field/id #uuid "fe2ba311-eb35-52a6-8e68-cb1044efda44" :answer-field